--TEST--
A second `get` or `set` hook on one property is `E0304` at the second hook, and one hook of each kind compiles
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Box {
    public int $width { get => 1; get => 2; }

    public int $height {
        get => 2;
        set(int $value) {}
        set(int $value) {}
    }

    public int $depth {
        get => 3;
        set(int $value) {}
    }
}

echo (new Box())->width, "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0304]: this property declares the `get` hook twice
%A
error[E0304]: this property declares the `set` hook twice
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
